## 📌 SLIDE 5 — KEY AI FEATURES (Part 1)
**Heading:** Vision + Deep Learning Pipeline

**Left Side — Computer Vision:**
- 🟢 **Lane Detection:** HLS color space + Hough Transform → real-time lane centering
- 🟠 **YOLOv8:** Detects cars, buses, pedestrians, stop signs
- 🔵 **Speed Limit Parsing:** Reads speed limit value (30/60/90) → auto-adjusts vehicle speed
- 🟣 **DeepSORT Tracking:** Unique ID per vehicle across all frames

**Right Side — Deep Q-Network (DQN):**
- Neural Net: `5 inputs → 128 → 64 → 4 actions`
- Learns: When to accelerate, brake, or steer
- **Experience Replay Buffer** (10,000 transitions)
- Reward: +10 speed, +5 lane center, +30 obstacle avoided, -100 collision

---

## 📌 SLIDE 6 — KEY AI FEATURES (Part 2)
**Heading:** Sensor Fusion + Traffic Behavior Prediction

**Left — LiDAR + Camera Fusion:**
- LiDAR generates **3D point cloud** (32 channels, 50K pts/sec)
- Points projected onto **2D camera frame**
- Exact distance per detected vehicle → **Time-to-Collision (TTC)**

| TTC Value | AI Response |
|-----------|-------------|
| < 1.5 sec | 🔴 Emergency Brake |
| < 3.0 sec | 🟠 Hard Brake |
| > 5.0 sec | 🟢 Clear Road |

**Right — Traffic Predictor (NEW):**
- Tracks velocity history of each car (15 frames)
- Classifies in real-time:
  - 🟢 MOVING | 🔴 BRAKING | 🟠 ACCELERATING | 💜 LANE CHANGE | ⬛ STATIONARY
- Draws **trajectory arrows** on HUD for predicted future path

